    `r 55-58 confined space hazards, control and atmosphere`
    `r 61 confined space signs`
    `r 63 confined space entry permit`
    `r 64 keeping entry permits`
    `r 68 record of exit from a confined space`
    `r 97-98 plant hazards and control`
    `r 99 guarding of plant`
    `r 155-156 safety data sheets`
    `r 162 register of hazardous substances`
    `r 163 controlling hazardous substances`
    `r 165 exposure standard not exceeded`
    `r 166 atmospheric monitoring`
    `r 167-168 results and records of atmospheric monitoring`
    `r 169 health monitoring for hazardous substances`
    `r 171 keeping health monitoring reports`
    `r 175 record of work with scheduled carcinogens`
    `r 176 statement of carcinogen work on leaving`
    `r 182 lead information to job applicants`
    `r 184 controlling lead risks`
    `r 186(1) lead exposure standard`
    `r 190(1) no eating, drinking or smoking in lead areas (employer)`
    `r 195(1) notice of lead-risk work`
    `r 196-198 lead health monitoring`
    `r 199 removal from lead-risk work`
    `r 200 medical examination after removal`
    `r 201(3) no return before the blood lead level falls`
    `r 204 keeping lead records`
    `r 205 no eating, drinking or smoking in lead areas (employee)`
    `r 210 asbestos exposure`
    `r 216 tools on asbestos`
    `r 218-224 asbestos prohibitions`
    `r 237 access to the employer's asbestos register`
    `r 238 controlling asbestos`
    `r 262 medical examinations, limited asbestos removal`
    `r 263 keeping asbestos medical summaries`
    `r 298 notice of asbestos removal work`
    `r 318 asbestos information to job applicants`
    `r 319L crystalline silica hazard control statement`
    `r 319Q silica information to job applicants`
    `r 319R silica information and training`
    `r 319S engineered stone dust controls`
    `r 319V respiratory protective equipment for engineered stone`
    `r 319Y engineered stone benchtops, panels and slabs`
    `r 325 controlling construction risks`
    `r 327 safe work method statement`
    `r 329 keeping the safe work method statement`
