    `r 341 construction induction card`
    `r 355 notice of construction excavation`

DECLARE `Offender` IS ONE OF
    `a natural person`
    `a body corporate`

-- The maximum fine in penalty units. NOTHING for r 45, which has neither an Act compliance note nor a penalty (NOTES.md
-- finding), and for r 205 committed by a body corporate (an employee's offence).
GIVEN `the provision` IS A `Provision`
      `the offender`  IS AN `Offender`
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
`the maximum fine in penalty units` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the provision`
    WHEN `r 20 confidentiality of health monitoring reports and copy to the person` THEN `either` 100 500
    WHEN `r 33 record of the noise determination` THEN `either` 100 500
    WHEN `r 35 hearing protector signs` THEN `either` 100 500
    WHEN `r 37 audiometric testing` THEN `s 22(1)`
    WHEN `r 38 audiological examination` THEN `s 22(1)`
    WHEN `r 39 audiological report` THEN `either` 60 300
    WHEN `r 40(1) keeping audiometric results` THEN `either` 60 300
    WHEN `r 45 ladders` THEN NOTHING
    WHEN `r 46 recording an administrative control for falls` THEN `either` 60 300
    WHEN `r 61 confined space signs` THEN `either` 100 500
    WHEN `r 64 keeping entry permits` THEN `either` 60 300
    WHEN `r 68 record of exit from a confined space` THEN `either` 60 300
    WHEN `r 155-156 safety data sheets` THEN `either` 100 500
    WHEN `r 162 register of hazardous substances` THEN `either` 100 500
    WHEN `r 166 atmospheric monitoring` THEN `s 22(1)`
    WHEN `r 167-168 results and records of atmospheric monitoring` THEN `either` 60 300
    WHEN `r 169 health monitoring for hazardous substances` THEN `s 22(1)`
    WHEN `r 171 keeping health monitoring reports` THEN `either` 60 300
    WHEN `r 175 record of work with scheduled carcinogens` THEN `either` 60 300
    WHEN `r 176 statement of carcinogen work on leaving` THEN `either` 60 300
    WHEN `r 182 lead information to job applicants` THEN `either` 5 25
    WHEN `r 190(1) no eating, drinking or smoking in lead areas (employer)` THEN `either` 100 500
    WHEN `r 195(1) notice of lead-risk work` THEN `either` 60 300
    WHEN `r 196-198 lead health monitoring` THEN `s 22(1)`
    WHEN `r 200 medical examination after removal` THEN `s 22(1)`
    WHEN `r 204 keeping lead records` THEN `either` 60 300
    WHEN `r 205 no eating, drinking or smoking in lead areas (employee)` THEN
        CONSIDER `the offender`
        WHEN `a natural person` THEN JUST 100
        WHEN `a body corporate` THEN NOTHING
    WHEN `r 218-224 asbestos prohibitions` THEN `either` 100 400
    WHEN `r 237 access to the employer's asbestos register` THEN `either` 100 500
    WHEN `r 262 medical examinations, limited asbestos removal` THEN `s 22(1)`
    WHEN `r 263 keeping asbestos medical summaries` THEN `either` 60 300
    WHEN `r 298 notice of asbestos removal work` THEN `either` 60 300
    WHEN `r 318 asbestos information to job applicants` THEN `either` 5 25
    WHEN `r 319Q silica information to job applicants` THEN `either` 5 25
    WHEN `r 319R silica information and training` THEN `either` 60 300
    WHEN `r 319Y engineered stone benchtops, panels and slabs` THEN `either` 100 500
    WHEN `r 329 keeping the safe work method statement` THEN `either` 60 300
    WHEN `r 334 principal contractor signs` THEN `either` 100 500
    WHEN `r 337 co-ordination plan available` THEN `either` 60 300
    WHEN `r 341 construction induction card` THEN `either` 100 500
    WHEN `r 355 notice of construction excavation` THEN `either` 60 300
    OTHERWISE `s 21`
    WHERE
        `either` `natural` `corporate` MEANS
            CONSIDER `the offender`
            WHEN `a natural person` THEN JUST `natural`
            WHEN `a body corporate` THEN JUST `corporate`
        `s 21` MEANS `either` 1800 9000
        `s 22(1)` MEANS `either` 240 1200

-- Whether the provision is enforced as a breach of a section of the Act (r 7) rather than as an offence of its own.
GIVEN `the provision` IS A `Provision`
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`the provision is enforced through the Act (r 7)` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the provision`
    WHEN `r 45 ladders` THEN NOTHING
    OTHERWISE
        IF `own penalty` THEN JUST FALSE ELSE JUST TRUE
    WHERE
        `own penalty` MEANS
            CONSIDER `the maximum fine in penalty units` `the provision` `a natural person`
            WHEN JUST `n` THEN NOT (`n` EQUALS 1800 OR `n` EQUALS 240)
            WHEN NOTHING THEN FALSE
